{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t佐敦有餐廳的廚房上午起火，消防到場撲救。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n警方上午9時半左右接獲多人報案，彌敦道近柯士甸道一間餐廳有濃煙冒出，顧客自行疏散，火警已救熄。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n初步調查指，餐廳廚房的抽油煙機起火，無人受傷。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：譚佩貞\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T03:01:25.586780+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":99,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T02:38:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T07:18:50.787210+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T02:58:41.920883+00:00","content_hash":"bf1727b179dd0a5f1af3f31abab0a4dae04467cf1427546cdbd22a10b424fbff","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}